<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Feb 17.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Feb 17.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 17	Feb 14     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> - USD =	  265.070     263.730     247.020    7.31 %</p>
<p> - ECU =	  304.100     303.890     306.830   -0.89 %</p>
<p> - DEM =	  156.430     156.440     158.970   -1.60 %</p>
<p> - FRF =	   46.350	46.360	47.182   -1.76 %</p>
<p> - GBP =	  429.720     427.080     419.180    2.51 %</p>
<p> - NLG =	  139.360     139.395     141.685   -1.64 %</p>
<p> - ITL (100) =   15.862	15.858	16.185   -2.00 %</p>
<p> - JPY (100) =  213.590     212.730     212.430    0.55 %</p>
<p> - ESP =	    1.850	 1.848	 1.888   -2.01 %</p>
<p> - PTE =	    1.560	 1.556	 1.581   -1.33 %</p>
<p> - CHF =	  179.500     180.555     183.135   -1.98 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
